    "body": "I'm interested in this idea also; I'd like to sync CSS & Lottie animations with an audio/video file.  Currently exploring using VTT as a unified timed RPC listing to trigger commands.\r\n\r\nFolks at Mux, Inc are taking a different approach to similar problem; they are[abstracting `<Video>` [with Custom Elements](https://github.com/muxinc/media-chrome) as a HTML-UI wrapper, vs an JS-API wrapper like you have here.  But maybe @heff or @luwes would like to give feedback anyhow?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
