    "updated_at": "2022-09-15T09:40:38Z",
    "body": "I think that makes sense to focus on an interface for just the media state/control API. Video can get more complicated with element attributes and child nodes (track, source). I see how it can makes sense to break that out of the requirement of being an element so it could work in other contexts like node. On that note, is it not a Media \"Element\" interface then?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
