    "updated_at": "2022-09-15T23:30:36Z",
    "body": "> On that note, is it not a Media \"Element\" interface then?\r\n\r\nYeah, the logic was `HTMLMediaElement` − `HTML`, but I guess `Element` should be subtracted as well. On the other hand, `Media` is too generic. Open to other suggestions; perhaps `MediaElement` → `Playable`, `SyntheticMediaElement` → `Playback`?",
